stateDiagram-v2
    state check <<choice>>
    [*] --> Input
    Input --> check
    check --> Valid : ok
    check --> Invalid : bad
    state fork1 <<fork>>
    Valid --> fork1
    fork1 --> Save
    fork1 --> Log
    state join1 <<join>>
    Save --> join1
    Log --> join1
    join1 --> [*]
    Invalid --> [*]
